    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3fb0a800747b4a8d",
      "translationZh": "我们正式发布 Transformers Agents 2.0！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b8c8ee99e02f3241",
      "translationZh": "⇒ 🎁 除了现有的智能体类型，我们还引入了两种新智能体，它们能够根据过去的观察结果进行迭代，以解决复杂任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e41c17cf3cbeeb53",
      "translationZh": "⇒ 💡 我们力求让代码清晰、模块化，并让最终提示词和工具等常用属性透明可见。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e4fc1868259f363",
      "translationZh": "⇒ 🤝 我们新增了分享选项，以助力社区智能体的发展。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dffbdb99c96c8de8",
      "translationZh": "⇒ 💪 全新智能体框架性能极其出色，让 Llama-3-70B-Instruct 智能体在 GAIA 排行榜上超越基于 GPT-4 的智能体！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc0a03cf591acd55",
      "translationZh": "🚀 快去试试，在 GAIA 排行榜上不断攀登新高！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "336790c4f8553e84",
      "translationZh": "transformers.agents 现已升级为独立库 smolagents！这两个库的 API 非常相似，因此切换起来很容易。点击此处查看 smolagents 的介绍博客。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a9360e0212a4d173",
