    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a5fca8de41591183",
      "translationZh": "对 LLM 引擎进行基准测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2cf97fe6bb7fa4b6",
      "translationZh": "利用多模态智能体在 GAIA 排行榜上提升排名",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0479f4286f117dc0",
      "translationZh": "什么是智能体？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f449a7de8ed2d84d",
      "translationZh": "大语言模型（LLM）能够处理各种各样的任务，但它们往往难以应对逻辑、计算和搜索等特定任务。当在这些表现不佳的领域收到提示时，它们经常无法生成正确答案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "39a0c574befc15a0",
      "translationZh": "克服这一弱点的一种方法是创建一个智能体，它其实就是一个由 LLM 驱动的程序。智能体借助工具获得执行操作的能力。当智能体需要某项特定技能来解决某个具体问题时，它会依靠工具箱中合适的工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "809c634579e99810",
      "translationZh": "因此，当智能体在解决问题的过程中需要某项特定技能时，它只需依靠工具箱中合适的工具即可。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "97d4c3e27c469a1f",
      "translationZh": "实验表明，智能体框架通常表现非常出色，在多个基准测试中达到了当前最先进的水平。例如，看看 HumanEval 中排名靠前的提交方案：它们都是智能体系统。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3cb5382faa96a4f2",
      "translationZh": "Transformers Agents 的设计思路",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4f29e0bc8efcac5",
      "translationZh": "构建智能体工作流很复杂，我们认为这些系统需要高度的清晰性和模块化。我们在一年前推出了 Transformers Agents，如今正加倍投入，坚持我们的核心设计目标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "285a0222f74864fe",
      "translationZh": "我们的框架致力于实现：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "291c5065a50111f1",
      "translationZh": "以简洁实现清晰：我们将抽象减少到最低限度。简单的错误日志和易于访问的属性，让你能够轻松检查正在发生的事情，更清楚地了解系统运行情况。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0392be6e4c1e7930",
      "translationZh": "模块化：我们更倾向于提供构建模块，而不是完整而复杂的功能集。你可以自由选择最适合自己项目的构建模块。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9ca1c7874a272112",
      "translationZh": "例如，既然任何智能体系统都只是一辆由 LLM 引擎驱动的车，我们就决定在概念上将两者分离，这样你就可以基于任意底层 LLM 创建任意类型的智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "257cbec8b2342c03",
      "translationZh": "除此之外，我们还提供了共享功能，让你能够站在巨人的肩膀上继续构建！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "145984ab4b15df0e",
      "translationZh": "主要组成部分",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "42e2da4abe152b2f",
      "translationZh": "Tool：这个类让你能够使用工具或实现一个新工具。它主要由一个用于执行工具操作的可调用 forward 方法，以及几个必要属性组成：name、descriptions、inputs 和 output_type。这些属性用于动态生成工具的使用手册，并将其插入 LLM 的提示词中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a6a76a6518d3ca0e",
      "translationZh": "Toolbox：这是一组提供给智能体的工具，作为解决特定任务的资源。出于性能考虑，工具箱中的工具都已实例化，随时可以使用。这是因为某些工具的初始化需要时间，所以通常最好复用现有工具箱，只替换其中一个工具，而不是在每次初始化智能体时都从头构建一组工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d6277ee775873ccb",
      "translationZh": "CodeAgent：一种非常简单的智能体，将其要执行的操作生成为一整块 Python 代码。它无法基于先前的观察结果进行迭代。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b07bab467f936634",
      "translationZh": "ReactAgent：ReAct 智能体遵循“思考 ⇒ 行动 ⇒ 观察”的循环，直到解决任务。我们提供两种 ReactAgent 类：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8cad22fc851bce3a",
      "translationZh": "ReactCodeAgent 将其要执行的操作生成为 python 代码块。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "95fa922ea0fef82e",
      "translationZh": "ReactJsonAgent 将其要执行的操作生成为 JSON 数据块。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "27ec4cc850cda82a",
      "translationZh": "查看文档，了解如何使用各个组件！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6266ef8f6ef54b59",
      "translationZh": "智能体的内部工作原理是什么？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9228184717e9f8a7",
      "translationZh": "本质上，智能体所做的就是“让 LLM 使用工具”。智能体有一个关键的 agent.run() 方法，它会：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "12845233e918f544",
      "translationZh": "在特定的提示词中向你的 LLM 提供工具使用信息。这样，LLM 就可以选择要运行的工具来解决任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2c2b01dec56e6004",
      "translationZh": "从 LLM 的输出中解析工具调用（可以通过代码、JSON 格式或任何其他格式）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "95e43fa36181898d",
      "translationZh": "执行这些调用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6b8ab85b00085016",
      "translationZh": "如果智能体被设计为基于先前的输出进行迭代，它会维护一份记忆，保存之前的工具调用和观察结果。这份记忆的细粒度程度可以有所不同，具体取决于你希望它保留多久。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a386244df67d961f",
      "translationZh": "要了解有关智能体的更多背景知识，你可以阅读 Lilian Weng 的这篇精彩博文，或我们之前关于使用 LangChain 构建智能体的博文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b8bbd9aea484468d",
      "translationZh": "要更深入地了解我们的软件包，请查看智能体文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "82451c8c4f6021e4",
      "translationZh": "应用场景示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fd0129b14b2acb63",
      "translationZh": "要抢先体验这项功能，请先从 transformers 的 main 分支安装：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1a7c2fdd39dd191",
      "translationZh": "Agents 2.0 将在 v4.41.0 版本中发布，于 5 月中旬上线。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ce4ba8f1571a88e1",
      "translationZh": "自我纠错的检索增强生成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c0b52c381868ead",
      "translationZh": "简要定义：检索增强生成（RAG）是指“使用 LLM 回答用户查询，但让回答以从知识库中检索到的信息为依据”。与使用原始或经过微调的 LLM 相比，它有许多优势：举几个例子，它可以让回答建立在真实事实之上，减少编造；可以为 LLM 提供特定领域的知识；还可以对知识库中的信息访问进行细粒度控制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d72d49ac86f55b46",
      "translationZh": "假设我们想要执行 RAG，而且某些参数必须动态生成。例如，根据用户查询，我们可能希望将搜索范围限制在知识库的特定子集中，或者希望调整检索出的文档数量。难点在于：如何根据用户查询动态调整这些参数？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "293525088cb20619",
      "translationZh": "其实，我们可以通过让智能体访问这些参数来做到这一点！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fdd82584e3cd219b",
      "translationZh": "让我们来搭建这个系统。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86d0f566f5e1e227",
      "translationZh": "运行下面这一行来安装所需的依赖项：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b2239b72c2cb95a",
      "translationZh": "我们首先加载一个用于执行 RAG 的知识库：这个数据集汇集了许多 huggingface 软件包的文档页面，并以 markdown 格式存储。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40230ff1c9ff7515",
      "translationZh": "现在，我们通过处理数据集并将其存入向量数据库来准备知识库，以供检索器使用。我们将使用 LangChain，因为它提供了出色的向量数据库实用工具：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "738ceb4adfb01daa",
      "translationZh": "现在数据库已经准备好了，让我们构建一个基于它回答用户查询的 RAG 系统吧！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "68528ace96ce1890",
      "translationZh": "我们希望系统根据查询，仅从最相关的信息来源中进行选择。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d05bf1d5cc583fc",
      "translationZh": "我们的文档页面来自以下来源：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ab6a352063aadf2",
      "translationZh": "我们如何根据用户查询选择相关来源呢？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac60ee9a42ed83f8",
      "translationZh": "👉 让我们将 RAG 系统构建成一个能够自由选择信息来源的智能体！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d39b02242eaca0c6",
      "translationZh": "我们创建一个检索器工具，智能体可以使用自行选择的参数来调用它：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df3c1b862603d165",
      "translationZh": "现在，创建一个利用此工具的智能体就很简单了！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb731b595530b438",
      "translationZh": "智能体在初始化时需要以下参数：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "06ae8bb47d18e33d",
      "translationZh": "tools：智能体能够调用的工具列表。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "42bb0b0b7f101b3b",
      "translationZh": "llm_engine：驱动智能体的 LLM。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02f14e54925f76f0",
      "translationZh": "我们的 llm_engine 必须是一个可调用对象，以消息列表作为输入，并返回文本。它还需要接受 stop_sequences 参数，用于指示何时停止生成。为方便起见，我们直接使用包中提供的 HfEngine 类，获得一个调用我们的 Inference API 的 LLM 引擎。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ff0938d6a5b482e",
      "translationZh": "由于我们将智能体初始化为 ReactJsonAgent，它已自动获得一个默认系统提示，要求 LLM 引擎逐步处理，并以 JSON 数据块的形式生成工具调用（你可以根据需要，将此提示模板替换为自己的模板）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e9a7ec320d89709",
      "translationZh": "随后，当其 .run() 方法启动时，智能体会负责调用 LLM 引擎、解析工具调用的 JSON 数据块，并执行这些工具调用；所有这些操作都在一个循环中进行，只有在给出最终答案时循环才会结束。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7296df96eafb25d",
      "translationZh": "我们得到以下输出：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bda7bbd0cd6fa4da",
      "translationZh": "我们可以看到自我纠正正在发挥作用：智能体最初尝试限制来源，但由于缺少相应的文档，最终完全没有限制来源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64f0543626511db6",
      "translationZh": "我们可以通过检查第 2 步日志中的 llm 输出来验证这一点：print(agent.logs[2]['llm_output'])",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a1903ab4bf8b6f2f",
      "translationZh": "使用简单的多智能体配置 🤝 实现高效网页浏览",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78ce78b1820c2d13",
      "translationZh": "在这个示例中，我们希望构建一个智能体，并在 GAIA 基准测试（Mialon 等人，2023）上对其进行测试。GAIA 是一个极其困难的基准测试，其中大多数问题都需要使用不同工具进行多步推理。一项尤为困难的要求是拥有一个强大的网页浏览器，能够在特定约束下浏览页面：利用网站内部导航发现页面、按时间选择特定文章……",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86c1613f3e87def7",
      "translationZh": "网页浏览需要深入子页面，并滚动浏览大量文本 token，而这些内容对于更高层级的任务求解并非必需。我们将网页浏览子任务分配给一个专门的网页浏览智能体。我们为它提供一些网页浏览工具和一个专用提示词（请查看代码仓库以找到具体实现）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bfe6786008e65893",
      "translationZh": "定义这些工具不在本文的讨论范围内，但你可以查看代码仓库以找到具体实现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1897ca7c0d85c82e",
      "translationZh": "为了让更高层级的任务求解智能体能够调用这个智能体，我们只需将它封装在另一个工具中：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb4990e95df61ca0",
      "translationZh": "然后，我们使用这个搜索工具来初始化任务求解智能体：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e1d0c03d2b992015",
      "translationZh": "让我们用以下任务运行智能体：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "27f6b7b7f11e4b2e",
      "translationZh": "请使用 LibreText 的《化学导论》资料（汇编日期为 08/21/2023）中，由 Marisa Alviar-Agnew & Henry Agnew 根据 CK-12 许可授权的化学材料里的密度数据。我有一加仑蜂蜜和一加仑蛋黄酱，温度均为 25C。我从这一加仑蜂蜜中每次取出一杯。需要取出多少次，才能让蜂蜜的重量小于蛋黄酱？假设容器本身的重量相同。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fad74abc6f657876",
      "translationZh": "✅ 而且答案是正确的！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "615dbc6544b1e801",
      "translationZh": "测试我们的智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8796f6ee4f8a8fc6",
      "translationZh": "让我们试用一下自己的智能体框架，并用它对不同模型进行基准测试！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce82e9bbab8308e1",
      "translationZh": "以下实验的所有代码都可以在这里找到。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a5fca8de41591183",
      "translationZh": "对 LLM 引擎进行基准测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "735fac3d3cb63c63",
      "translationZh": "agents_reasoning_benchmark 是一项规模虽小但能力强大的推理测试，用于评估智能体的表现。我们在之前的博文中已经使用过这一基准测试，并作了更详细的解释。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "092c50d91f353a0f",
      "translationZh": "这里的思路是，你为智能体选择的工具可能会极大地改变其在某些任务上的表现。因此，这项基准测试将可用工具限制为计算器和一个基础搜索工具。我们从多个数据集中挑选了仅使用这两种工具就能解决的问题：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "52d9d78b56316edc",
      "translationZh": "从 HotpotQA（Yang 等人，2018）中选取 30 道题，以测试搜索工具的使用能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a8123fbb854b3b09",
      "translationZh": "从 GSM8K（Cobbe 等人，2021）中选取 40 道题，以测试计算器的使用能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d89b792dae0630b5",
      "translationZh": "从 GAIA（Mialon 等人，2023）中选取 20 道题，以测试结合使用这两种工具解决难题的能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "25081982db361d04",
      "translationZh": "这里我们尝试了 3 种不同的引擎：Mixtral-8x7B、Llama-3-70B-Instruct 和 GPT-4 Turbo。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "30a0fa295d08eaee",
      "translationZh": "结果如上所示——为提高精确性，结果取两次完整运行的平均值。我们还测试了 Command-R+ 和 Mixtral-8x22B，但为使展示更清晰，没有列出它们的结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d23b117d1bc1793f",
      "translationZh": "⇒ Llama-3-70B-Instruct 在开源模型中领先：它与 GPT-4 不相上下，而且得益于 Llama 3 强大的编程能力，它在 ReactCodeAgent 中的表现尤其出色！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f39477128a462e02",
      "translationZh": "💡 对比基于 JSON 和基于代码的 React 智能体很有意思：使用 Mixtral-8x7B 这类能力较弱的 LLM 引擎时，基于代码的智能体表现不如基于 JSON 的智能体，因为 LLM 引擎经常无法生成优质代码。但使用更强大的模型作为引擎时，代码版本就真正大放异彩了：根据我们的经验，使用 Llama-3-70B-Instruct 时，代码版本的表现甚至优于 JSON 版本。因此，我们将在下一个挑战中使用代码版本：在完整的 GAIA 基准测试上进行测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2cf97fe6bb7fa4b6",
      "translationZh": "借助多模态智能体攀升 GAIA 排行榜",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e13587e4665f19c",
      "translationZh": "GAIA（Mialon 等，2023）是一个极具挑战性的基准测试：从上面的 agent_reasoning_benchmark 可以看出，即使我们精心挑选了仅用 2 个基本工具就能解决的任务，模型的表现也未能超过 50%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "610a9e5fa0f6fe59",
      "translationZh": "现在，我们希望在完整的任务集上获得一个分数，不再挑选问题。因此，我们必须覆盖所有模态，这就需要使用以下这些专门的工具：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7b3908e09f3aa9d3",
      "translationZh": "SearchTool：上面定义的网页浏览器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "76ba1abf1ace0e85",
      "translationZh": "TextInspectorTool：将文档作为文本文件打开，并返回其内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4c6320000c477bd8",
      "translationZh": "SpeechToTextTool：将音频文件转写为文本。我们使用基于 distil-whisper 的默认工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "34d2d1cef2960d40",
      "translationZh": "VisualQATool：对图像进行视觉分析。为此，我们使用闪亮登场的全新 Idefics2-8b-chatty！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "21903492b1fef415",
      "translationZh": "我们首先初始化这些工具（更多细节请查看代码仓库中的代码）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7838790d126f3e04",
      "translationZh": "然后，我们初始化智能体：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "30b8904c45eec31d",
      "translationZh": "花了一些时间完成这 165 道题后，我们将结果提交到 GAIA 排行榜，然后…… 🥁🥁🥁",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e2a04688496f13e",
      "translationZh": "⇒ 我们的智能体排名第 4：它击败了许多基于 GPT-4 的智能体，如今已成为开源类别中领先的竞争者！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76e613a3d4bea9e4",
      "translationZh": "未来几个月，我们将持续改进这个软件包。我们已经在开发路线图中确定了几个令人兴奋的方向：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "33c49ee79c82bb72",
      "translationZh": "更多智能体共享选项：目前，你可以向 Hub 推送工具或从中加载工具，我们也将实现智能体的推送和加载功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e3059aff9201da08",
      "translationZh": "更好的工具，尤其是用于图像处理的工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "53fcdbfc8af68b72",
      "translationZh": "长期记忆管理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1d812ee039d2bf3c",
      "translationZh": "多智能体协作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6f42deb8140b7d3",
      "translationZh": "👉 快去试试 transformers agents 吧！我们期待收到你的反馈和想法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ea9c19df22299f6",
      "translationZh": "让我们用更多开源模型占据排行榜的前列！🚀",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "336790c4f8553e84",
      "translationZh": "transformers.agents 现已升级为独立库 smolagents！这两个库的 API 非常相似，因此切换很容易。快来这里看看 smolagents 的介绍博客。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
